        "exchangeRowSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"custodyRowSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"workRowSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"captureArgumentsSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},
        "enrollmentSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"historicalEnrollmentRootSpkiSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},
        "rawResponseSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"rawResponseEnvelopeSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},
        "tokenEnvelopeSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"tokenSecretSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},
