    "transport": {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["schema","requestSha256","status","receivedAtEpochNs","rawResponseSha256","rawResponseEnvelope"],"properties":{"schema":{"const":"serverware.nativeOAuthCaptureRetirementTransport/v1"},"requestSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"status":{"oneOf":[{"type":"null"},{"type":"integer","minimum":200,"maximum":599}]},"receivedAtEpochNs":{"$ref":"#/$defs/epoch"},"rawResponseSha256":{"$ref":"#/$defs/digest"},"rawResponseEnvelope":{"$ref":"oauth-exchange-authority.v1.schema.json#/$defs/envelope"}}}
